              ":question/id": "127ac025-aa32-505a-98d8-27721a37fdbe",
              ":question/math-academy-id": "e-12829",
              ":question/problem": "What is the value of $\\sqrt{126}$ rounded to $3$ decimal places?",
              ":question/worked-solution": "Using a calculator, we find that\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{126}=11.224\\,972\\,160\\,...\n$$\n\nNow, we round to $3$ decimal places:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{126} \\approx 11.225\n$$"
            },
